{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"166","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Rank List"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Another programming contest is over. You got hold of the contest's final results table. The table has the following data. For each team we are shown two numbers: the number of problems and the total penalty time. However, for no team we are shown its final place."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You know the rules of comparing the results of two given teams very well. Let's say that team "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" solved "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pa"},{"kind":"text","text":" problems with total penalty time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ta"},{"kind":"text","text":" and team "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" solved "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pb"},{"kind":"text","text":" problems with total penalty time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"tb"},{"kind":"text","text":". Team "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" gets a higher place than team "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the end, if it either solved more problems on the contest, or solved the same number of problems but in less total time. In other words, team "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" gets a higher place than team "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the final results' table if either "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pa > pb"},{"kind":"text","text":", or "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pa = pb"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ta < tb"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is considered that the teams that solve the same number of problems with the same penalty time share all corresponding places. More formally, let's say there is a group of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" teams that solved the same number of problems with the same penalty time. Let's also say that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" teams performed better than the teams from this group. In this case all teams from the group share places "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y + 2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"..."},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y + x"},{"kind":"text","text":". The teams that performed worse than the teams from this group, get their places in the results table starting from the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y + x + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th place."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to count what number of teams from the given list shared the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th place. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ n ≤ 50"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Then "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the description of the teams: the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ti"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ pi, ti ≤ 50"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of solved problems and the total penalty time of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th team, correspondingly. All numbers in the lines are separated by spaces. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the only line print the sought number of teams that got the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th place in the final results' table."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7 2\n4 10\n4 10\n4 10\n3 20\n2 1\n2 1\n1 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 4\n3 1\n3 1\n5 3\n3 1\n3 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The final results' table for the first sample is: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" 1-3 places — 4 solved problems, the penalty time equals 10 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" 4 place — 3 solved problems, the penalty time equals 20 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" 5-6 places — 2 solved problems, the penalty time equals 1 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" 7 place — 1 solved problem, the penalty time equals 10 "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The table shows that the second place is shared by the teams that solved 4 problems with penalty time 10. There are 3 such teams."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The final table for the second sample is:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" 1 place — 5 solved problems, the penalty time equals 3 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" 2-5 places — 3 solved problems, the penalty time equals 1 "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The table shows that the fourth place is shared by the teams that solved 3 problems with penalty time 1. There are 4 such teams."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"166A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/166/problem/A"}